The following HTTPS links refer to the immutable upstream v2.0.18 release. They describe that upstream snapshot, not this consumer's current state or operational authority:

- [Full factory documentation](https://github.com/Dimkox/adaptive-grok-build-pro/blob/v2.0.18/factory/README.md).
- [Program roadmap](https://github.com/Dimkox/adaptive-grok-build-pro/blob/v2.0.18/DARK_FACTORY_ROADMAP.md).
