- [Local control-plane recovery reference](https://github.com/Dimkox/adaptive-grok-build-pro/blob/v2.0.18/engineering/runbooks/m4-v2.0.13-local-control-plane.md).

Runtime installation templates, factory project-state files, deployed Trust CI policy, credentials and production state are not shipped here. Choose runbooks matching the separately approved runtime source before operational use. Deployment, persistent database writes, live provider calls and publication each retain their own exact authorization and external approval requirements. Never use a shared, Trust CI or production database for disposable tests, or read an existing secret `.env` as part of source development.
